cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this forecast, method or scorecard, please cite it as below."
title: "Almanac: forecasts of forest loss in the Amazon and Cerrado, sealed before the truth exists (issue 2027.01)"
abstract: >-
  A forecast of forest loss in 2026 for 640 m cells on 499 exam tiles of the Amazon and Cerrado,
  made from AlphaEarth satellite embeddings up to 2025 and sealed on 22 November 2026, before any
  2026 loss map exists. The task, exam tiles, metric and win condition were pre-registered and
  timestamped before any model was trained. On a single graded backtest on 2025 the model's
  average precision was 16.0% above the reference (95% interval +10.7% to +22.3%), short of the
  pre-registered 20% margin.
